# Cast-iron mooring bollard (solid, 1 tile) standing on a deck: a squat
# post with a wide rounded cap (its top rows 1-2 are the walking surface),
# a waist and a flared foot plate. Iron ramp i/m/d (no k: a static solid
# tile), lit left with an i highlight on the cap, d right side and
# underside of the cap.
sprite = tile_poller
size   = 16x16
origin = 0,0
anim   = idle frames=1
